@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/
Accept: application/json

### 2. Developer Dashboard (Overview of Tasks, Outbox, Delegations)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/dev/dashboard
Accept: application/json

### 3. Start Workflow - Permohonan Capex Asset (Draft)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/workflow/start
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: 1
X-User-Name: Budi Santoso

{
  "tipeDisposisi": 201,
  "idForm": 501
}

### 4. Submit Capex to Supervisor (Step 1 -> Waiting Supervisor)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/workflow/next
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: 1
X-User-Name: Budi Santoso

{
  "idTask": 0,
  "idUrutanDisposisi": 1,
  "idDokumen": "CPX-2026-0001",
  "noDokumen": "DOC/CPX/2026/X/001",
  "idForm": 501,
  "selectedApproverId": 2,
  "catatanDisposisi": "Pengajuan pengadaan server cloud enterprise cluster",
  "documentAmount": 150000000
}

### 5. Get Task Detail (Approver / Viewer View)
# Ganti idTask dengan ID yang dikembalikan dari step 4
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/workflow/get
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: 2
X-User-Name: Siti Rahmawati

{
  "idTask": 1
}

### 6. Supervisor Approves & Escalates to Finance Director (Step 2)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/workflow/next
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: 2
X-User-Name: Siti Rahmawati

{
  "idTask": 1,
  "idUrutanDisposisi": 2,
  "idDokumen": "CPX-2026-0001",
  "noDokumen": "DOC/CPX/2026/X/001",
  "idForm": 501,
  "selectedApproverId": 5,
  "catatanDisposisi": "Disetujui. Telah sesuai dengan alokasi budget Q4.",
  "documentAmount": 150000000
}

### 7. Finance Director Final Approval (Step 4 -> Completed)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/workflow/next
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: 5
X-User-Name: Agus Salim

{
  "idTask": 1,
  "idUrutanDisposisi": 4,
  "idDokumen": "CPX-2026-0001",
  "noDokumen": "DOC/CPX/2026/X/001",
  "idForm": 501,
  "catatanDisposisi": "Approved final. Lakukan penerbitan PO.",
  "documentAmount": 150000000
}

### 8. Pendaftaran Delegasi Wewenang (Cuti / Plt / Pjs)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/workflow/delegations
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: 2
X-User-Name: Siti Rahmawati

{
  "idUserPenerima": 6,
  "idTipeDisposisi": null,
  "tanggalMulai": "2026-10-18T00:00:00Z",
  "tanggalSelesai": "2026-10-31T23:59:59Z",
  "alasanDelegasi": "Cuti Tahunan & Perjalanan Dinas Luar Kota"
}

### 9. Cek Delegasi Aktif Saya
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/workflow/delegations/my-active
X-User-Id: 2
Accept: application/json
